Z||000000||TwisT||03-07-2001||10:03 PM||||I have a Fiero project.  It is named by me...  it is called "ITALFIERO."  Meaning,  "ital" for "italian" and Fiero for,  well,  you know...<P>When I modify my hood to accomodate a functional/simple/attractive grilled vent,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install a late-model Mustang Saleen wing on the ass-end of my Fiero,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install four '79 Camaro/Firebird fender-vents on my trunk lid to extract air from the engine compartment,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install the same fender-vents on the lower intake panel and passenger-side panel,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install SuperX's white-faced gauges in my GT,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install a Momo steering wheel in my beloved Fiero,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install a chrome-ball gate-style shifter in my Fiero,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I mold a FOCOA Kid Danger air-dam to the nose of my GT,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I lower my suspension for increased handling performance and for general appearance,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install 18" wheels front/  19" wheels rear,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I install a cold-air kit into my Fiero so she can breathe easier,  please don't call it rice.<P>When I paint my car Viper Red,  please don't call it rice.<P>When my Fiero finally looks like no other Fiero you've ever seen,  has unique,  outstanding mods, yet remains subtlely pleasing to the eye and screams, <P>"I AM A SPORTS CAR!  I AM BRIGHT RED AND I'M IN YOUR FACE!!!  I AM EXOTIC AND QUICK!!!  I AM NOT A MUSCLE CAR,  I AM NOT AN IMPORT,  I AM NOT ANYTHING YOU'VE EVER SEEN!!!"<P>...THEN,  AND ONLY THEN do you have the right to call it rice!  After all,  that's how these things go now a' days.  EVERYTHING is rice now,  you hear???  Do you understand me???  EVERYTHINGGGGGGGGGGGGGG!!!!!!!!!!!<P>Uncle Ben is our new leader,  bow DOWN to his riceness!!!  <P>Anyway...  I'm venting out of frustration now.  Not over anti-ricers...  no...  but over the fact that I am now due to shatter all of my Fiero dreams so that my white,  untanned hairy-ass may move to and live in the Carribean.  Yes,  the Carribean.<P>I wonder if they have any Fieros on St. Martin...<P>Brett<P>P.S.  Beach week is on the Travel Channel,  WOOOOOOWOOOOOOOOO!!!<P>||||reg||1
